            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ Buffet",
            "review_text": "Callista N\n3 contributions\n0\nHard to eat\nDec 2017 • Family\nMy family of 6 visited this restaurant a few weeks ago and our experience was not pleasant. The staff and layout of restaurant were great however the meat for the bbq was one of the worst we’ve had. It is extremely tough and hard to eat. Especially as we had 3 younger children and an elderly woman, they were barely able to eat anything. Last week we went to another franchise in the Vincom Mega Mall Thao Dien, to see if it was just that restaurant and to give it a second chance. Unfortunately we were met with the same situation of the poor meat and we didn’t even bother finishing our meal. The staff here were nice and offered to pay for two of our drinks seeing we didn’t even get half way through the course. I wouldn’t recommend this place if you have young children. Overall the food was disappointing but staff were nice.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2018",
