            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ Buffet",
            "review_text": "Duy_Duy_N\n6 contributions\n0\nAmazing Korean BBQ buffet\nOct 2017 • Business\nI was there with my business partners for a dinner. The decoration was elegant and staffs were kind all the time. We took the highest price on the list as usual. The ordering processes were quick and food came out pretty fast. There are many food can fit all of our taste. Pork, beef, lettuce, poultry and sea food were fresh and serve with a nice decoration. Sauces are great, drinks are also very nicely mixed.\nWill come here again soon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 20, 2017",
